// built and .claude/plans/mpa-chopping-block-plan.md for the tool design.
// NOT auto-regenerated by `npm run database:sync` (unlike items.generated.js)
// — this file is meant to outlive the spreadsheet. Edit it directly (or ask)
// to add or update items going forward.
//
// Scope: Multiplicative/Mixed upgraders only (Additive-type upgraders have no
// stacking multiplier, so MPU/MPA/MPS do not apply and they are intentionally
// excluded). 'kind' distinguishes item shapes:
//   - straight: one fixed multi/area/length/mpa/mpu/mps.
//   - scalesWithUses: multiple owned copies change the numbers (Incremental,
//     Tiki, Lambda) — see each item's 'uses' array and 'bestUses'.
//   - scalesWithEffects: Dream Machine — real formula, computed live from a
//     player-reported effect count (perEffectBonus, formula fields).
//   - scalesWithConfiguration: Dragon's Breath / Portable Spinner — named
//     configurations (see 'configs'), not a simple owned-count.
//   - comboInfoOnly: Replicator + Dual Plasma combo — list-only, excluded
//     from Chopping Block entirely (see excludeFromChopping).
//
// 'category'/'subcategory' place each item in Chopping Block's ownership
// screen (crate / merchant-achievement-rebirth / p2w / other), derived once
// from data/items.index.json's sourceSheets and the hand-built 'packs' map
// below (not re-derived at runtime) — re-run this derivation by hand if the
// database changes which sheet an item is sourced from.
//
// 'packs' maps each P2W pack name to its member item names (hand-built —
// not derivable from a clean spreadsheet column). 'dependencies' lists
// combo/prerequisite locks for Chopping Block's removal ranking (requiresAny
// true means any one of 'requires' satisfies the lock, e.g. Hoarded
// Treasure OR Electric Overdrive for Alien Invasion). More are expected to be
// added later.

